SUMMARY:Fall Into Family History at Santa Rosa County Libraries
DESCRIPTION:The library system's lead reference specialist visits one bran
 ch each Wednesday in October to help people start or extend a family tree
 . Visitors can bring a specific research question or simply stop by to le
 arn how to get started with the library's genealogy resources. The help r
 uns during regular library hours\, so no appointment time is listed.\nPri
